stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> NEW : watcher inserts
  NEW --> IGNORED : no rule matches
  NEW --> SUPPRESSED : cooldown or daily cap
  NEW --> ACTING : rule matches, PAPER or notify only
  NEW --> AWAITING_CONFIRM : rule matches, LIVE trade
  AWAITING_CONFIRM --> ACTING : you confirm
  AWAITING_CONFIRM --> DECLINED : you decline
  AWAITING_CONFIRM --> EXPIRED : no answer in time, or price moved too far
  ACTING --> DONE
  ACTING --> FAILED
  IGNORED --> [*]
  SUPPRESSED --> [*]
  DECLINED --> [*]
  EXPIRED --> [*]
  DONE --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*]
